# ============================================================
# CYBERDUDEBIVASH SENTINEL APEX — .vercelignore
# ============================================================
#
# This project has no build step (static HTML/CSS/JS + Vercel serverless
# functions, see package.json), so anything committed to `main` and not
# listed here gets served as-is at its repository path. The files below
# are internal governance, architecture, and business-strategy
# documentation — never customer-facing, verified by grep that no
# published page (index.html, posts/, other root .html) links to any of
# them. Excluding them here removes them from the deployment bundle
# entirely, which is the actual access control; robots.txt (updated
# alongside this file) is defense-in-depth for bots that ignore
# deployment-level restrictions or hit a stale cached copy.
#
# Found exposed and fixed 2026-07-27: CLAUDE.md and Sentinel-APEX/README.md
# were live and Google-indexable at blog.cyberdudebivash.in before this fix.

CLAUDE.md
Sentinel-APEX/
eito/
platform/
prompts/
BUSINESS-TRANSFORMATION-ROADMAP-2026.md
AUDIT-REPORT-2026-05-28.md
OPERATIONS.md
